{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/oI7GV85ddpHT81g2tDTClA","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:57:44.623903+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/oI7GV85ddpHT81g2tDTClA","html":"<div><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/iaACVbcpOKJRsWSMMDVZuyxI5oHgib2w0bLZoCjBNmRDltC8SVLZcf5RMFHvFU5nPlSibxzvkorfRzHt8J8n6NRSA/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>一</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span><span>学院概况</span></span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_gif/iaACVbcpOKJRsWSMMDVZuyxI5oHgib2w0bmSTd944dXL95pcXBG18BcCbLs9SmEZ2Nj1szdR1r53LCNEyNGUYvNg/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>一</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>历史沿革</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/iaACVbcpOKJRsWSMMDVZuyxI5oHgib2w0bRZmIwwQ3Pgr0qHNticQEN5f60DSXWVhCs3spr8BAObicneG1zlb7a42g/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>二</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>办学定位</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>学院依托学校国防学科特色及优势，面向新时代国家安全重大战略需求，瞄准安全-防护-应急科技前沿，扎实推进安全科学与工程、土木工程学科交叉融合发展，在发展过程中形成了易燃易爆物质安全理论与应用、动载破坏效应与任性防护、智能安全与应急救援保障、绿色低碳能源安全技术、前沿探索基础研究等多个特色鲜明的学科方向。</span></p></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/iaACVbcpOKJRsWSMMDVZuyxI5oHgib2w0bht3B65BPtdBHCYW98OncO9Ucj7SuHDNJibCRGeerelWzhuibxhyluWaQ/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>三</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>机构设置</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>安全科学与工程学院（应急管理学院）下设安全工程系、防护工程系、应急保障系、重要目标韧性防护研究中心等4个内设机构，建有安全防护与应急技术教学实验中心，现有安全科学与工程（一级学科博士点）、土木工程2个一级学科。安全工程、土木工程2个本科专业，均为国家一流本科专业。</span></p></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>四</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>学院规模</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>学院现有教职员工80余人，其中专任教师60余人，高级职称49人，教育部长江学者1人，国家级青年人才5人，江苏省特聘教授1人，获省部级以上人才称号达20人次。学院邀请了杨秀敏院士、任辉启院士、王明洋院士组成指导专家团队，拥有何勇教授领衔的全国高校黄大年式教师团队。</span></p></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>五</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>科学研究</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><span>学院建院以来已承担科技部国家重点研发计划项目、军科委重点项目、国防科工局重大专项、工信部国家科技重大专项、国家自然科学基金等省部级以上重点科研项目40余项，承担其他各类科研项目及课题100余项，授权发明专利80余项（转化10项），到校科研经费逾3亿元，在国内外核心期刊发表高水平学术论文400余篇，近两年已荣获国家科学技术进步二等奖、国防科级进步奖一等奖、中国岩石力学与工程学会科技进步奖特等奖、中国岩石力学与工程学会自然科学奖一等奖等省部级以上奖励。</span></span></p></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/iaACVbcpOKJRsWSMMDVZuyxI5oHgib2w0b6hNfFZ6rCNmryibS4P35ELicn5X5XxUAD12EUuuVp1WmtUaTGPzJyZibA/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><p><span>学院作为智能极端力学与防护技术实验室(国家级重点实验室)主建单位之一，建有江苏省地下空间智能感知JM融合创新平台、爆炸物处置与安全防护江苏省公安厅重点实验室、中国民航上海审定中心共建驾驶舱防劫机试验平台、人防工程防护设备抗力性能检测平台等科研平台。建有工信部含能材料及其安全技术实验教学中心、土木工程与力学实验中心等教学平台，具有国内目前唯一的“隧道防护门整体抗爆性能”检测资质。</span></p></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/iaACVbcpOKJRsWSMMDVZuyxI5oHgib2w0bVVbz3cibkDZtxT5IEsTJiac2yYhGKByzM7EQWH2WXiapt2AKQwuDV8Piaw/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>六</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>学生培养</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/iaACVbcpOKJRsWSMMDVZuyxI5oHgib2w0bkdTmmLLYekRT42TWZE1clxno6whgKKxOIchScQHbicWrXQNoicQ7bia6A/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/iaACVbcpOKJRsWSMMDVZuyxI5oHgib2w0bTgSeObqbSmBjjg1ImdSH9dn1ZZtQFyB0c9DcfNOBuj3qdibO8oT61IQ/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><p><span>学院高度重视学生培养工作，2022年以来多名学生在学科竞赛中荣获国省级荣誉50余项，包括中国国际大学生创新大赛国际赛道研究生创意组金奖、第十届全国安全科学与工程大学生实践与创新大赛一等奖等。</span></p></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/iaACVbcpOKJRsWSMMDVZuyxI5oHgib2w0bq130ibCy6XR5hqLib1CPJjnkrnS80FBUfCU8kEaykPP14E5chwyZ7gHQ/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>七</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>对外交流</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>学院不断推进国际化进程，首次牵头了由中国主导的非正式工作组，首次实现中国提交的非正式提案直接被联合国TDG采纳，牵头被联合国采纳爆炸品相关标准提案3项，在研国家自然科学基金国际合作交流项目国际合作项目3项。</span></p><p><span>学院紧扣立德树人根本任务，致力于为国家培育安全领域多学科交叉的创新领军人才，就业升学率常年保持在95%以上。学院近年来多位毕业生在兵器工业集团、兵器装备集团、中国船舶集团、国家电网以及地市级应急管理局、公安局、高校、研究所等企事业单位任职。多位毕业生赴加州大学伯克利分校、悉尼大学、清华大学、中国科学技术大学、哈尔滨工业大学等国内外知名高校深造。</span></p><p><span>学院将以习近平新时代中国特色社会主义思想为引领，以“总体国家安全观”为指导，全面落实立德树人根本任务，牢记“为党育人、为国育才”使命担当，紧密结合国家重大安全战略需求，为国家培育安全领域多学科交叉的创新领军人才，为国家安全事业发展贡献智慧与力量！</span></p><p><strong><span><span>注：2026年学院招收的硕士研究生均在南京校区培养</span></span></strong><span>。</span></p></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>二</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>开放日</span></strong><strong><span>基本信息</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_gif/iaACVbcpOKJRsWSMMDVZuyxI5oHgib2w0bmSTd944dXL95pcXBG18BcCbLs9SmEZ2Nj1szdR1r53LCNEyNGUYvNg/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>1 </span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>人数</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>80</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>2 </span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>开展形式</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>线上</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>3</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>申请时间</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>2025年7月21日-24日</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>4</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>申请条件</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>（1）申请人应为全国高校在校生（2026年应届毕业生），且学习成绩优异、英语水平良好（四六级成绩或其他资格考试证明）；</span></p><p><span>（2）申请人本科专业为安全、土木、化工、材料、仪器、机械等相近专业，有较好的专业素养和较强的创新能力；</span></p><p><span>（3）申请人对科学研究有浓厚的兴趣，且具有较强科研工作能力；</span></p><p><span>（4）申请人具有良好的思想品德和政治素质，遵纪守法，身心健康，在校期间无违纪行为、未受过处分。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>5</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>申请程序</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>登录研究生院招生网站（https://gs.njust.edu.cn/zsw/）点击“校园开放日申请登录”填写报名信息。报名结束后，学院根据学科特点、开放日规模，选择一定数量学生参加开放日活动，并通过邮件方式进行通知。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>6</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>申请材料</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>请将以下材料按序号整理排序，扫描后合并为一个PDF文件，要求有目录、页数和页眉，在每一页的右上角页眉处做好内容标记，方便专家查看。PDF命名方式：为“本科院校+姓名+本科专业”。该PDF文件请于7月24日18:00前发送至邮箱：yz133@njust.edu.cn，请勿重复发送。所提交的材料务必保证真实准确，若弄虚作假，一经发现，立即取消申请资格。</span></p><p><span>（1）本人居民身份证和学生证原件。</span></p><p><span>（2）现有本科阶段成绩单与专业总评成绩排名原件（须学校教务部门或学院盖章）。</span></p><p><span>（3）外语水平证明（如CET-4、CET-6、TOEFL、IELTS等的证书或成绩单）。</span></p><p><span>（4）其他材料，如校级及以上获奖证书、公开发表的学术论文、资格证书等。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>7</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>活动日程</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/iaACVbcpOKJRsWSMMDVZuyxI5oHgib2w0bqA4PS7h1cHZsqibV915zdhsO1iclfXnvn03mmnUUXpArQfnbmkzumDVQ/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>8</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>其他</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>（1）未能参加开放日活动的同学可关注学院后期活动。</span></p><p><span>（2）本公告由安全科学与工程学院（应急管理学院）招生工作领导小组负责解释。</span></p><p><strong><span><span>联系方式</span></span></strong></p><p><span>联系人：张老师</span></p><p><span>联系电话：025-84315830</span></p><p><span>电子邮箱：yz133@njust.edu.cn</span></p></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/iaACVbcpOKJRsWSMMDVZuyxI5oHgib2w0bjCbf74HZ8liabfaoLe3ujLtamrLx2ZDZ1I5SyBTCh1NaTMHhM7MyoUA/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span>出品 | 南京理工大学研招办</span></p><p><span>来源 | 安全科学与工程学院（应急管理学院）</span></p><p><span>编辑 | 代芳冰</span></p><p><span>初审 | 秦俊华 安全科学与工程学院（应急管理学院）</span></p><p><span>审核 | 齐玉辉</span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><p></p></div>","textSha256":"80a5377f02dea6f93a57ecd0e3320f4e2173fa251f98e0d6d8073d0f2a0309af","textLength":2237,"sourceSha256":"939739c40c531d13c924c65f08472630f74de2a7056cf6cfbb7a3e3e69d4cf66","selector":"#js_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-09be97204d818d9eb254","title":"2025年南京理工大学安全科学与工程学院（应急管理学院）2025年校园开放日活动公告","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:57:44.623903+00:00"}
